WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Bheka ukuthi umoya onamandla nowomile uvela kuphi.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Tshala ngokunqamula umoya ohlangothini ovela kulo.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Yenza umugqa omude ongenazikhala. Umoya uyashesha lapho kunesikhala.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Izihlahla zidedela umoya othile. Odongeni oluqinile umoya uyazungeza.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Beka ezinde ngasohlangothini lomoya, ezimaphakathi phakathi, nezihlahlana eziphansi ngaphambili.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Shiya isikhala phakathi kwezihlahla nezitshalo ukuze ukukhanya kufinyelele emibhedeni.
